  "prompt": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Một cái lều có dạng hình lăng trụ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có cạnh bên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông góc với đáy (Hình bên). Cho biết <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tính góc giữa hai đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tính diện tích hình chiếu vuông góc của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trên mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/222270c291776cf8dbb9a35fe914a4357c41f68d1339539426238e3d25355363.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
